WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:09,390
You rely on words to defraud various companies of supplies

2
00:00:09,790 --> 00:00:11,990
I came here today to collect everyone's things

3
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:17,450
Here are the rations saved by our ancestors and grandchildren.

4
00:00:17,650 --> 00:00:19,040
Just take it away from us

5
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,360
The physical array should have been distributed to the residents of the boxing building

6
00:00:26,760 --> 00:00:28,760
Let us take away the unified Qingdian first

7
00:00:40,390 --> 00:00:43,190
Taking advantage of other people's materials by deception is now reaping the consequences.

8
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:44,990
It's a farce
